  "name": null,
  "problem": "For which of the following values is the Trapezoidal Method stable, given that $\\lambda $ is the parameter of the test equation?\n\nI. $\\lambda Δx=0.45$\n\nII. $\\lambda Δx=1.7$\n\nIII. $\\lambda Δx=3.2$\n\nIV. $\\lambda Δx=9.4$\n\n*Hint: The stability function $R$ of the Trapezoidal Method is given by*\n\n$$\nR(\\lambda Δx)=\\frac{1-\\lambda Δx/2}{\\,1+\\lambda Δx/2}.\n$$",
